      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-293552",
      ":question/problem": "Mila received the following scores for each of the five questions she answered on a math test:\n$3, 2, 3, 1, 0$\nMila's friend Roger took the same test and scored a mean of $2$ points.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. Mila's mean score is $2$ points per question.\n2. Roger's mean score is larger than Mila's.\n3. A comparison of the means suggests that Mila performed better in the test overall.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
